<model version="5.1.3" links="0">
 <documentation>Blinky for RP2040 boards on the Earle Philhower arduino-pico core, using the QP/C++ 7.3.4 QV kernel from qp-arduino. Built for the qp-arduino RP2040 qualification fixture (mouse-joystick-pcb rev 0) with -DQP_ARDUINO_FIXTURE_MOUSE_JOYSTICK_PCB=1: the &quot;LED&quot; is FW_TRIG0 (GP25) and the tick-ISR probe is FW_TRIG1 (GP21), both visible on the LA5032 through InstrumentPort-40. Without that flag the LED is LED_BUILTIN. See examples/blinky_bsp-rp2040/README.md.</documentation>
